'''Gemstone''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It uses a large crystalline amethyst shard as its blade, which leads into the sword’s golden cross-guard with long quillons. In the center of the guard is a tiny purple gemstone, along with another gemstone being present in the center of the handle’s curved golden pommel. The handle is brown in color with tape wrapped around it. 

== Trivia ==
* It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update and was also the first Season 1 godly to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Gemstone]], which can be found in the same box.
* Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/1678314358/Crystal-Blade-Amethyst-Attack Crystal Blade: Amethyst Attack].
*This and [[Chroma Gemstone]] are the only Season 1 godlies not to be created by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

